<title>CANADA: Loewen boosts dividend by 25 percent.</title>
<headline>Loewen boosts dividend by 25 percent.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Funeral home operator Loewen Group Inc said on Wednesday it increased its semi-annual dividend to US$0.10 a share from US$0.08.</p>
<p>The common share dividend will be paid on July 2 to shareholders of record June 18.</p>
<p>Loewen stock closed up 0.50 to 42.50 in Toronto today. ((Reuters Vancouver Bureau 604-664-7314))</p>
